on-arrival: resources -= 2; media_capacity += 6; local_network += 2; public_trust += 2; ko_relation -= 1; news_headline = "An independent desk tracks both public-media management and government procedure"

Newsroom unions, regional broadcasters and media lawyers receive one address
for disputed dismissals, procurement and political instructions. The reports
will follow the transition after the cameras leave the ministry steps.

We spend scarce organisation on watching an institution somebody else runs.
That is weaker than a board seat and more durable than outrage at a single
appointment.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the monitoring file on the events desk

@december_public_media_pis
# prose-audit: Grade B — The surviving-PiS counterfactual now names the live executive and regulator, respects opposition authority and retains three concrete aftermaths; it remains a compact sibling to the full transfer scene.
