on-arrival: {!
const pslInCabinet =
    Q.government_has_confidence &&
    !Q.caretaker_government &&
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) > 0 &&
    (
        Boolean(Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet) ||
        ["economy", "agriculture", "defence"].some(function(portfolio) {
            return Q[portfolio + "_minister_party"] == "PSL";
        })
    );
Q.farmers_psl_in_cabinet = pslInCabinet ? 1 : 0;
if (pslInCabinet) {
    Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 6;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
}
Q.news_headline = pslInCabinet
    ? "Farmer protests turn PSL into the coalition's hinge and hostage"
    : "Farmer protests force every parliamentary party to choose a rural line";
!}

= February 2024 — Tractors at the ministry gates

Family farmers arrive in Warsaw beside larger operators who can survive a
long blockade. Ukrainian grain, supermarket contracts and the Green Deal sit
on the same placards although they do not put money into the same pockets.

AgroUnia founder Michał Kołodziejczak wants the government to prove it can
trace who captures the margin. PSL leader Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz wants his
party recognised as the countryside's indispensable broker. Lewica must decide
whether to investigate the market, lend PSL the negotiation, or defend a green
transition before the smallest farms believe they can afford it.

- @farmers_labor
- @farmers_psl
- @farmers_green

@farmers_labor
title: Separate family farms from processors and large landholders
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Follow margins from field to processor and supermarket; anger actors who benefit from calling every farm interest the same.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The policy operation is already overextended.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_support += 5; labor_credibility += 3; psl_relation += 2; ko_relation -= 1; ukraine_solidarity += 1; news_headline = "The Left follows margins through the agricultural supply chain"

Our investigators put purchase contracts, processor margins and supermarket
prices beside farm-gate income. Family farmers can point to the part of the
chain taking their work; Ukrainian producers are no longer asked to carry the
whole explanation.

Agribusiness and coalition liberals call the inquiry an attack on the market.
Kołodziejczak gains evidence, PSL gains pressure and Lewica begins to sound as
if rural labour belongs in its economic programme.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the supply-chain file on the events desk

@farmers_psl
title: Let PSL negotiate safeguards and claim the settlement
subtitle: Give Kosiniak-Kamysz the rural microphone; stability improves, but Lewica will not own whatever the blockade wins.
on-arrival: {!
Q.psl_relation += 8;
Q.psl_coalition_dissent -= 5;
Q.rural_support += 2;
if (Q.farmers_psl_in_cabinet) Q.government_delivery += 2;
else Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.party_unity -= 1;
Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
Q.news_headline = Q.farmers_psl_in_cabinet
    ? "PSL returns from the blockade as the coalition's rural broker"
    : "PSL, not Lewica, negotiates with the cabinet while the Left backs family farms";
!}

Kosiniak-Kamysz takes the farm organisations into a separate room and returns
with safeguards bearing PSL's name. [? if farmers_psl_in_cabinet: Its ministers
can now turn the terms into cabinet delivery, and the coalition's most exposed
partner comes back from the blockade strengthened.?][? if not
farmers_psl_in_cabinet: PSL can mediate with the cabinet but cannot order it;
the agreement is political pressure rather than a ministerial act.?]

The protest quiets enough for negotiations to continue. Lewica has protected a
partner and conceded the photograph which tells rural voters who acted for
them.

- @poland_event_queue: Return PSL's settlement to the events desk

@farmers_green
title: Defend climate transition and compensate the smallest farms
subtitle: Keep the environmental destination and propose protection for family farms; the blockade may hear costs before it hears compensation.
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 4; rural_support -= 3; psl_relation -= 5; ko_relation += 2; far_right_agenda += 3; government_coalition_dissent += 3 if left_in_government = 1; news_headline = "A green transition proposal fails to end the blockade"

We refuse to promise that every environmental obligation will disappear and
put targeted protection for the smallest farms beside the transition. Climate
organisations finally hear a governing party defend the destination.

At the blockade, proposed compensation sounds less immediate than the next
bill. PSL withdraws from our line and the radical right translates transition
into abandonment before any payment can prove otherwise.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the green farm proposal on the events desk

@kanal_zero_launch
# prose-audit: Grade A — Stanowski's role and borrowed audience are explicit, and every interview strategy now retains what happens to the speaker, host and party organisation.
title: Stanowski launches Kanał Zero
subtitle: A host becomes an institution without becoming a party
