@abortion_presidential_decision
title: The bill reaches the President
subtitle: A Sejm majority is not a signature
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const abortionRightWingPresident = [
    "Andrzej Duda",
    "Karol Nawrocki",
    "Sławomir Mentzen",
    "Grzegorz Braun"
].includes(Q.president_name);
const abortionHostilePresident =
    abortionRightWingPresident && Q.government_party != "pis";
Q.abortion_presidential_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.president_relation) || 0) +
    (Q.abortion_implementation_prepared ? 8 : 0) +
    (Q.abortion_strategy == "Decriminalisation sequence" ? 5 : 0) +
    (Q.abortion_strategy == "Material compromise" ? 4 : 0) +
    ((Number(Q.public_trust) || 45) - 45) * 0.15
);
if (!abortionHostilePresident || Q.abortion_presidential_score >= 55) {
    Q.abortion_presidential_action = "Signed into law";
    Q.abortion_law_enacted = 1;
    Q.abortion_cabinet_deadline = 0;
    Q.feminist_trust += 5;
    Q.president_relation += 2;
    Q.news_headline = Q.president_name + " signs decriminalisation";
} else if (Q.abortion_presidential_score >= 34) {
    Q.abortion_presidential_action = "Referred to the Constitutional Tribunal";
    Q.abortion_law_enacted = 0;
    Q.court_user_trust -= 2;
    Q.feminist_trust -= 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.president_name + " refers decriminalisation to the Tribunal";
} else {
    Q.abortion_presidential_action = "Presidential veto";
    Q.abortion_law_enacted = 0;
    Q.feminist_trust -= 4;
    Q.president_relation -= 4;
    Q.news_headline = Q.president_name + " vetoes decriminalisation";
}
Q.last_policy_stage = "Presidential consideration";
Q.last_policy_authority = Q.president_name;
Q.last_policy_implementation = Q.abortion_law_enacted
    ? "Enacted; clinical delivery remains to be funded"
    : "Blocked before implementation";
!}

= Presidential action: [+ abortion_presidential_action +]

[? if abortion_presidential_action = "Signed into law": The President accepts
the Sejm's answer and puts a signature beneath decriminalisation. The breadth
of the bill, the relationship built with the Palace and the prepared clinical
brief have made assent easier; enactment still leaves hospitals to change
their practice.?]
[? if abortion_presidential_action = "Referred to the Constitutional Tribunal":
The President refuses both assent and an immediate veto, sending the bill to
the Constitutional Tribunal instead. The Palace calls that caution. Patients,
clinicians and organisers experience it as delay with no date of release.?]
[? if abortion_presidential_action = "Presidential veto": The President uses
the veto and returns the bill to a Sejm that cannot presently muster the votes
to override it. A parliamentary victory has become a presidential campaign,
while the criminal law remains in force.?]

The incumbent's politics, Lewica's relationship with the Palace and the
credibility of its implementation plan all shaped this decision. None of them
allows a ministry to treat an unsigned bill as law.

