The launch puts coalition partners, pensioner organisations and ZUS guidance
on one platform. No party asks a bereaved claimant to sort the parliamentary
history before applying.

Lewica receives less exclusive credit and more willingness from KO and PSL to
open the next social negotiation. The benefit becomes evidence that the
government can act together rather than evidence that only we made it act.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the shared achievement to the events desk

@suwerenna_merger_talks_2024
