= September 2024 — A junior partner prices its disappearance

Zbigniew Ziobro remains the ill leader of Suwerenna Polska while party
vice-president Patryk Jaki negotiates its future. Jarosław Kaczyński wants one
PiS organisation after the loss of government, but his party must decide how
many vice-presidencies, list places, debts and local branches arrive with the
justice-ministry network.

Lewica has no vote in either party. We can give Jaki an outside policy success,
make Ziobro's record the public price of absorption, or publish the terms and
let their members own the choice. October will still belong to the two
organisations; September decides the pressure under which they meet.

- @suwerenna_merger_social
- @suwerenna_merger_attack
- @suwerenna_merger_observe

@suwerenna_merger_social
title: Offer a victim-protection and social-policy concession across the aisle
subtitle: A proposed concession lowers merger pressure; only a later government act can improve household security.
on-arrival: suwerenna_merge_support -= 5; suwerenna_merge_dissent += 3; government_favors += 1; household_policy_pressure += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; pis_relation += 2; last_policy_stage = "Negotiated concession"; last_policy_authority = "Party-to-party channel"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "A narrow policy concession gives Suwerenna Polska an outside option"

Our parliamentary channel offers Jaki a narrow victim-protection and household
package he can support without a PiS merger. Suwerenna politicians gain a way
to show their members that a separate organisation can still produce a result.

Nothing has been implemented: another party has conditionally agreed to pursue
the proposal, and the competent government and Sejm must still act. Progressive
members ask why preserving Ziobro's vehicle deserved even that opening.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the proposed concession on the events desk

@suwerenna_merger_attack
title: Publicly make the Ziobro record the price of a PiS merger
subtitle: The attack raises internal dissent but can also harden the smaller party.
on-arrival: suwerenna_merge_support -= 4; suwerenna_merge_dissent += 10; progressive_credibility += 3; pis_relation -= 4; far_right_agenda += 2; news_headline = "Lewica turns the proposed merger into an argument about the justice record"

We put prosecutors, disciplinary courts and the blocked European funds beside
every promised vice-presidency. PiS candidates are asked whether absorbing
Jaki's organisation means accepting common responsibility for Ziobro's term at
Justice.

Some PiS officials become less willing to pay the price. Suwerenna activists
hear an attempt to erase them through prosecution and rally around the very
identity the attack was meant to make toxic.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the justice-record attack to the events desk

@suwerenna_merger_observe
title: Publish the organisational terms and let both parties vote
subtitle: Transparency favours the negotiated historical route; Lewica selects no leader.
on-arrival: suwerenna_merge_support += 12; suwerenna_merge_dissent -= 3; media_capacity += 2; constitutional_restraint += 1; news_headline = "The merger terms reach members before either leadership can declare victory"

Our media team obtains and publishes the proposed offices, branch rules and
legal timetable without endorsing them. Members of both parties can see what
their leaders mean by unity before a staged convention declares it complete.

The disclosure reduces rumours and makes a negotiated merger easier to defend.
Lewica gains a clear record and declines the fantasy that clever commentary can
choose Kaczyński's or Jaki's organisation for them.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the published terms on the events desk

@suwerenna_merger_decision_2024
# prose-audit: Grade A — Ziobro, Jaki, Kaczyński and the organisation's live legal form now emerge from the dynamic result, and every Lewica response retains an outcome-specific political consequence.
title: Suwerenna Polska decides whether to merge with PiS
subtitle: The result follows the organisations' accumulated support and dissent
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 24
order: 12
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2024 and month = 10 and suwerenna_renamed = 1 and suwerenna_merged = 0
on-arrival: {!
const solidarna = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "solidarna";
});
const mergerSupport = Number(Q.suwerenna_merge_support) || 0;
const mergerDissent = Number(Q.suwerenna_merge_dissent) || 0;
Q.suwerenna_individual_joiners = 0;
if (mergerSupport >= 60 && mergerDissent <= 45) {
    Q.suwerenna_merged = 1;
    Q.suwerenna_merger_result = "Full merger into PiS";
    Q.suwerenna_seats = 0;
    if (solidarna) {
        solidarna.active = 0;
        solidarna.kind = "caucus";
        solidarna.allied = 1;
        solidarna.legal_status = "merged current inside PiS";
        solidarna.cohesion = Math.max(58, solidarna.cohesion - 8);
        solidarna.defection_readiness = 0;
    }
    Q.news_headline = "Suwerenna Polska dissolves into PiS after a negotiated vote";
} else if (mergerSupport >= 43 && mergerDissent < 34) {
    Q.suwerenna_merger_result = "Federated United Right agreement";
    Q.suwerenna_seats = 0;
    if (solidarna) {
        solidarna.active = 1;
        solidarna.allied = 1;
        solidarna.legal_status = "federated allied party";
        solidarna.electoral_outside_option = "federated United Right partner";
    }
    Q.news_headline = "Suwerenna Polska keeps its legal identity inside a federation";
} else if (mergerDissent >= 34) {
    Q.suwerenna_merger_result = "Merger refused";
    const independentSeats = Math.min(
        Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0)),
        Math.max(
            0,
            Math.round(Number(solidarna && solidarna.mp_count) || 0)
        )
    );
    Q.suwerenna_seats = independentSeats;
    Q.pis_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) - independentSeats
    );
    if (
        Q.government_party == "pis" && Q.government_has_confidence &&
        !Q.caretaker_government
    ) {
        Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
            0,
            (Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 0) - independentSeats
        );
        Q.coalition_seats = Math.max(
            0,
            (Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0) - independentSeats
        );
    }
    if (solidarna) {
        solidarna.active = 1;
        solidarna.allied = 0;
        solidarna.legal_status = "independent party after refused merger";
        solidarna.mp_count = independentSeats;
        solidarna.sejm_mps = independentSeats;
        solidarna.defection_readiness = Math.max(
            65,
            Number(solidarna.defection_readiness) || 0
        );
        solidarna.exclusive_seats = independentSeats;
    }
    Q.news_headline = "Suwerenna Polska refuses the final merger terms";
} else {
    Q.suwerenna_individual_joiners = 4;
    Q.suwerenna_merger_result = "Individual accessions; party survives";
    Q.suwerenna_seats = 0;
    if (solidarna) {
        solidarna.active = 1;
        solidarna.allied = 1;
        solidarna.mp_count = Math.max(0, solidarna.mp_count - 4);
        solidarna.sejm_mps = Math.max(0, solidarna.sejm_mps - 4);
        solidarna.legal_status = "surviving party after individual accessions";
    }
    Q.news_headline = "Four Suwerenna politicians join PiS while the party survives";
}
!}

= October 2024 — [+ suwerenna_merger_result +]

Zbigniew Ziobro's party has taken its own decision after Patryk Jaki negotiated
with Jarosław Kaczyński. **[+ news_headline +].**

[? if suwerenna_merger_result = "Full merger into PiS": The separate treasury,
branches and leadership disappear into PiS; Jaki and the former Justice
Ministry network survive as an organised current under Kaczyński.?][? if
suwerenna_merger_result = "Federated United Right agreement": Suwerenna Polska
keeps its legal identity, officers and bargaining table while promising one
electoral camp with PiS.?][? if suwerenna_merger_result = "Merger refused":
The party keeps its own MPs and organisation outside PiS. Kaczyński has failed
to turn the old coalition into a single opposition machine.?][? if
suwerenna_merger_result = "Individual accessions; party survives": Four
politicians cross to PiS, but Jaki retains a smaller party and the right now has
to explain both loyalty and desertion.?]

Lewica did not choose this organisational result. We choose whether to open a
narrow parliamentary channel, demand one record of accountability, or invite
individual staff and councillors to leave the justice-war inheritance behind.

- @suwerenna_result_nonaggression
- @suwerenna_result_attack
- @suwerenna_result_recruit

@suwerenna_result_nonaggression
title: Offer a vote-by-vote non-aggression channel
subtitle: Test social and institutional votes without endorsing the right's settlement; our own factions will suspect a favour before they see a result.
