[? if left_in_government: The fund publishes municipal allocations and lets
mayors procure urgent repairs beside the rescue services already on the ground.
Households receive faster help, and every contract can be traced to a town and
need.?][? if not left_in_government: Our mayors coordinate needs, contracts and
oversight while the cabinet retains the relief money. The public record speeds
