Local government owns more of the success and more of any misuse. Lewica gains
relationships with the people rebuilding streets rather than only the minister
announcing totals.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the transparent relief fund on the events desk

@flood_central
title: Centralise command and promise fast compensation
subtitle: Cabinet only. Give the Prime Minister one chain of command and one promise; every delayed payment will return to the same desk.
