Our spokespeople promise that Ukrainians will no longer receive preferential
treatment. The phrase reassures voters who believe the queue is rigged without
requiring us to identify the rule which rigged it.

Ukrainian workers and children hear collective suspicion from a party which
once defended them. Mentzen welcomes the premise and returns with harsher
terms; we gain a hearing inside his argument and make it larger.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the preference claim to the events desk

@migration_pivot_2024
